# Keep Cloud Build source uploads reproducible and free of local runtime state.
# The verification/build configs only consume the application and Terraform.
# Default-deny every other top-level path.  Two reviewed test inputs are
# reopened below by exact type/path: canonical KB JSON metadata/content and the
# incident-drill contract.  Business exports, planning notes and unrelated
# worktree content remain excluded.
**
!.gcloudignore
!kb-rag-system/
!kb-rag-system/**
!infra/
!infra/terraform/
!infra/terraform/**
!PA/
!PA/**/
!PA/Loans/Vanguard: How to Submit a Loan Request.json
!PA/Loans/LT: 401(k) Loan Complete Guide — Submission, Repayment & Support.json
!PA/Loans/401(k) Loan Basics and Support Guide.json
!PA/Participant Dashboard/LT: Managing Your 401(k) Statements and Beneficiaries.json
!PA/Participant Dashboard/Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) for Your ForUsAll 401(k) Account.json
!PA/Participant Dashboard/LT: How to Set Up Your ForUsAll 401(k) Account.json
!PA/Distributions/ForUsAll 401(k) Hardship Withdrawal — Complete Guide (Rules, Fees, Steps, Timelines).json
!PA/Distributions/401(k) Required Minimum Distributions (RMDs): Rules, Deadlines, Penalties, Exceptions, and Roth Conversion Impact.json
!PA/Distributions/Can I Take Money From My 401(k) While Employed? Your Options Explained.json
!PA/Distributions/ADP-ACP Refund Checks: Unexpected Checks, Taxes, Timing, and Prevention.json
!PA/Distributions/EACA Refunds After 401(k) Auto-Enrollment: 90-Day Deadline, Eligibility, Fees, and Tax Reporting.json
!PA/Distributions/401(k) Options After Leaving Your Job (Terminated Distribution): Rollovers, Cash Outs, Roth and Pre-Tax.json
!PA/Distributions/The 401(k) Force-Out Process: Clean Up Your Plan, Cut Risk, Stay Compliant.json
!PA/Distributions/401(k) Force-Out Process: Sponsor FAQ — Eligibility, Thresholds, Notice Requirements, and Compliance.json
!PA/Distributions/LT: Can I Split My 401(k) Rollover Between Multiple Providers?.json
!PA/Distributions/LT: How to Request a 401(k) Termination Cash Withdrawal or Rollover.json
!PA/Distributions/Missed 60-Day Indirect Rollover Deadline: Tax Consequences, IRS Exceptions, and When to Refer to a Tax Professional.json
!PA/Distributions/How Do I Cancel or Change a Pending Distribution Request?.json
!docs/
!docs/verification/
!docs/verification/handle-ticket/
!docs/verification/handle-ticket/11-incident-drill-template.md
!External agents/
!External agents/Inquiry Extraction & Required-Data Builder agent .md
!External agents/Knowledge Question Inquiry Generator.md
!External agents/Generate Response Body Builder.md
!External agents/Forusbots field mapper.md

.git
.git/**

# Python environments and generated caches.
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/*.py[cod]

# Terraform working directories are regenerated from the provider locks.
**/.terraform/**

# Local credentials and environment overrides must never enter build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/sa-key.json
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json

# Historical live/stress captures contain prompts, model replies and financial
# examples.  They are not inputs to the authoritative test suite; only the
# deterministic differential harness is uploaded.
kb-rag-system/rag-testing/**
!kb-rag-system/rag-testing/
!kb-rag-system/rag-testing/ground_truth.py
!kb-rag-system/rag-testing/ticket_differential.py
!kb-rag-system/rag-testing/ticket_differential_thresholds.json
kb-rag-system/STRESS_TEST_COMPARISON_REPORT.md
kb-rag-system/Development Docs/**
!kb-rag-system/Development Docs/
!kb-rag-system/Development Docs/HANDLE_TICKET_RUNBOOK.md

# Desktop/editor noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/*~
